# Hanzo, Akuma Ninja

> Hanzo's rework flipped his risk model. The body you once had to hide is now invincible the moment his ultimate is active, and the fragile thing is the ghost you pilot and the Energy that keeps it alive. Pick him as a jungler who hunts the enemy carry through walls and walks away untouched, as long as you never feed Hanekage a free death.

