## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle On-Hit Default (Jungle)

- Items: Swift Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Malefic Roar, Hunter Strike
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Swift, Seasoned Hunter, War Cry
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Swift Boots when Use when slows, stuns, or magic poke keep catching Hanzo's body before the soul fight starts.; Sea Halberd over Hunter Strike when Use when sustain fighters or shield supports outlast the first Hanekage entry.; Wind of Nature over Hunter Strike when Use against physical divers who can reach the real body during Lord or base-defense fights.
- Total cost: 11010 gold

Default jungle setup for stacking Dark Ninjutsu quickly, abusing Basic Attack effects in Hanekage form, and cutting through frontliners after Golden Staff comes online.

### Jungle Pickoff Burst (Jungle)

- Items: Magic Boots, Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar
- Core: Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, Endless Battle
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Magic Boots when Use when chain crowd control matters more than shaving seconds from Hanzo's non-ultimate skills.; Rose Gold Meteor over Blade of Despair when Use when magic burst is the only threat that can punish Hanzo's real body after he commits ultimate.; Immortality over Blade of Despair when Use for final Lord fights when one revive is worth more than the last burst spike.
- Total cost: 12070 gold

Burst jungle setup for isolated carry hunts where Hanzo needs Ambush, cooldown, and penetration more than extended on-hit DPS.

### Jungle Snowball Execute (Jungle)

- Items: Swift Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Sky Piercer, Malefic Roar
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Swift, Seasoned Hunter, War Cry
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Flame Retribution
- Flex: Hunter Strike over Sky Piercer when Use when the early snowball fails and Hanzo needs reliable cooldown plus movement instead of execute stacks.; Wind of Nature over Sky Piercer when Use when protecting a shutdown is more important than raising the execute threshold.; Immortality over Sky Piercer when Use once death timers decide the game and losing Sky Piercer stacks would end Hanzo's tempo.
- Total cost: 10500 gold

High-risk snowball setup for games where Hanzo wins the first jungle cycle, invades with lane cover, and converts early kills into Sky Piercer pressure.

